<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-J.LEAGUE NABISCO CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-J.LEAGUE NABISCO CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the J.League Nabisco Cup final played on Wednesday night:</p>
<p>    Shimizu S-Pulse  3    Verdy Kawasaki   3 (after extra time.</p>
<p>90 mins: 2-2. Shimizu won 5-4 in penalty shootout)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Shimizu - Kenta Hasegawa (68th minute), Oliva (81st), Santos (91st)</p>
<p>Kawasaki - Takumi Horiike (own goal 87th), Argel 89th, Bismarck 106th).</p>
<p>Attendance: 28,232</p>
</text>
